      "text": "METROBASE Traffic Update as of 7:15pm\n\nWHEN: March 5, 2026\n\nA. MAJOR ROADS:\n\n*EDSA\nSOUTHBOUND \n- Bansalangin, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Buendia to Magallanes, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Tramo to Taft, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nNORTHBOUND\n- FB Harrison to Taft Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ayala to Buendia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Orense to Ortigas, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Santolan to Aurora, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- New York to Kamias, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Trinoma to QC Academy, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Oliveros to Balintawak, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*C5\nSOUTHBOUND\n- Magsaysay to UP Town Center, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Miriam to Ateneo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- B. Serrano, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Eastwood, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Lanuza, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Bagong Ilog, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- McKinley to Palar, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Market Market to Bagong Ilog, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Lanuza, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Ortigas to Calle Industria, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Bonny Serrano, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P.Tuazon to Ateneo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- UP Town Center, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Magsaysay, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*COMMONWEALTH\nEASTBOUND:\n- Manggahan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Doña Carmen to FCM Regalado, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Banawe, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Sct. Borromeo to Elliptical Rd., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Delta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Araneta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n- SM Marikina to Masinag (Antipolo), slow moving (due to volume of vehicles and Incident at LRT Masinag)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- EDSA to Meralco, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Lanuza, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nWESTBOUND\n- Greenmeadows to Meralco, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Katigbak, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Quirino to P. Ocampo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Airport Rd., moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Coastal, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P. Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- P. Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Buendia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)  \n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Arnaiz, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P. Ocampo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P. Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n#mmda",
